From d9722bcd5709ad7f787008d2d8a78c1be21d10f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 05:35:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] [web] ui_web: host embedding hooks

A page embedded in an app's WebView (for example a root manager's module
WebUI) cannot learn some platform state from the browser: safe-area
padding, the host's pause/resume, its dark mode, how to close. These hooks
let the embedding supply them. Every value is null in a browser tab, and
null keeps today's behaviour.
